 <p class="hint" style="margin:0 0 8px"><b>Off</b> = never appears · <b>Allowed</b> = might appear · <b>Guaranteed</b> = always appears. E/Z needs a C=C inside the chain, so Guaranteed E/Z always adds one. <b>No-number names</b>: names where every number is dropped because each group has only one possible spot.</p>
