 <div class="ctl"><b>Difficulty</b><input type="range" min="1" max="5" value="${CFG.diff}" oninput="setDiff(this.value)" style="width:min(260px,60%)"><span id="dfl">${CFG.diff} · ${DN[CFG.diff-1]}</span></div>
 <div class="ctl"><span>Strikes</span>${seg([['1','1'],['3','3'],['0','None']],String(CFG.lives),'setLives')}<span>Draw as</span>${seg([['lewis','Lewis'],['skel','Skeletal'],['random','Random']],VMODE,'pickView')}</div>
 <button class="pri play" onclick="startGame()">Play ▶</button></div>
 <div class="card" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Polymers &amp; monomers</h3><p class="hint" style="margin:0 0 8px">A separate game from Lesson 8. You build the answers yourself: draw the repeating unit from the monomers, work back from a polymer to its monomers, identify addition / polyester / polyamide, and count links, water and broken C=C bonds.</p>
 <div class="cats">${[['add','Addition polymers'],['cond','Condensation polymers'],['conc','Definitions & stages (multiple choice)']].map(([k,t])=>`<div class="cat2"><b>${t}</b><div class="seg">${[['0','Off'],['1','On']].map(([v,n])=>`<button class="${(CFGP[k]?1:0)==v?'on':''}" onclick="setPoly('${k}',${v})">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>
 <div class="ctl"><b>Difficulty</b><div class="seg">${[['1','Easy'],['2','Medium'],['3','Hard']].map(([v,n])=>`<button class="${(CFGP.d||1)==v?'on':''}" onclick="setPolyD(${v})">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div><span class="mono">Hard = rings, CH(Cl), CH=CH, mixed OH/NH₂ monomers, one-step condensations like the board</span></div>
