 <div class="ctl"><b>Difficulty</b><div class="seg">${[['1','Easy'],['2','Harder'],['3','Deep thinking']].map(([v,n])=>`<button class="${(CFGQ.d||1)==v?'on':''}" onclick="setPropD(${v})">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>
 <button class="pri play" onclick="startGame('prop')">Play properties ▶</button></div>
 <div class="card" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Quick rules</h3><p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7">Lowest number goes to (highest first): <b>COOH › ester/ether › CHO › C=O › OH › SH › C=C/C≡C › branches</b>.<br>
 Lower endings go in brackets, the top one is last: <i>pentan-(3-one)-oicacid</i> · <i>2-methylbutan-(3-one)-al</i> · <i>1-chloropent-(3-yne)-2-one</i> · <i>decan-(3-thiol)-5-ol</i><br>
 "an" stays unless there is a C=C/C≡C: <i>decan-…</i> vs <i>but-(2-ene)-oicacid</i> · A lone OH is <i>-ol</i>; next to C=O/CHO/COOH/ether it is <i>hydroxyl</i>.<br>
 Esters: <i>1-butylethanoate</i> · <i>3-(6-chloro-5-methyl)-heptylmethanoate</i> · <i>1-(3-hydroxyl)-cyclopent-(4-ene)-yl-(3-methyl)-benzanoate</i><br>
